cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
type: software
title: "CONFIGURE: Cost-benefit OptimisatioN Framework for Implementing blue-Green infrastructURE (version 1.0)"
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/asidurrehman/Configure10"
authors:
  - given-names: Asid
    family-names: Ur Rehman
abstract: >-
  CONFIGURE integrates a multi-objective optimisation algorithm (NSGA-II)
  with a hydrodynamic flood model to optimise the costs and benefits of
  Blue-Green Infrastructure (BGI) interventions, using the locations of BGI
  features as decision variables. It can run in a standard mode or a
  parallelised mode that evaluates candidate solutions simultaneously.
keywords:
  - NSGA-II
  - multi-objective optimisation
  - blue-green infrastructure
  - urban flooding
  - flood risk management
